    "content": "Here are some of the best snorkelling spots around Providenciales, recommended by locals:\n\nBight Reef (Coral Gardens): Easy shore entry, abundant fish, suitable for beginners. Located near Grace Bay.\n\nSmith's Reef: Another excellent shore-entry spot with coral formations and tropical fish. Less crowded than Bight Reef.\n\nNorthwest Point: For experienced snorkellers — dramatic wall diving and larger marine life. Go with a guide if unfamiliar.\n\nTip: Always snorkel with a buddy. Check current conditions before entering the water. Do not touch coral or marine life.\n\nHave a favourite spot? Share it in the comments below!",
